# The web app (Next.js). NEXT_PUBLIC_* are inlined at build time: restart `pnpm dev` after a change.

# B13c1: mocks off. The API answers every route; run it with `pnpm dev:api` (apps/api/README.md).
#   disabled  no MSW (every deployment: demo, production and Vercel previews)
#   enabled   MSW answers everything in the browser, with no API: offline UI work and the Playwright pilot specs
#   hybrid    MSW running, but every route passes through to the API (kept for the bridge-cookie tests)
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_MOCKING=disabled
# Where Next's /api rewrite sends requests (next.config.ts). Unset: no rewrite (only with `enabled`).
API_PROXY_TARGET=http://localhost:4100
